  "methods": "Included is the PRISMA final set: the works included at full text (at title and abstract when the protocol has no full-text stage). Read in full is the set of works with a live first-pass row of a listed miner. Where they differ, every work is listed by id: a duplicate record that was read under its own id is shown on the canonical record; a work that was read but excluded is listed with its exclusion criterion and not shown in corpus views; a work read under a duplicate record whose canonical record is not included is listed apart as 'duplicate of an excluded work' and not shown in corpus views; an included work with no rows of its own or of a merged duplicate is 'not read yet'.",
